WEBVTT

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:02.216
he's exactly describing Wikipedia.

00:01:02.240 --> 00:01:03.669
And what I'm going to do today

00:01:03.693 --> 00:01:07.093
is tell you a little bit more
about how it really works on the inside.

00:01:07.960 --> 00:01:11.096
So Wikipedia's owned
by the Wikimedia Foundation,

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:12.336
which I founded,

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:13.776
a nonprofit organization.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:17.816
And our goal, the core aim
of the Wikimedia Foundation,

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:21.016
is to get a free encyclopedia
to every single person on the planet.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:23.056
And so, if you think
about what that means,

00:01:23.080 --> 00:01:25.616
it means a lot more
than just building a cool website.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.656
We're really interested
in all the issues of the digital divide,

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:30.256
poverty worldwide,